26197 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 26198 0 R/Alt(Line plot of the heterozygous fraction of the F1, on a vertical axis zoomed to the range of the draws, against the Balding-Nichols parameter from 0.02 to 0.40; the six single-draw points scatter over a range of 0.0046 around a dashed horizontal line at the expectation, 0.365, about as much as the replicate bars, and the figure cannot separate a flat line from a small trend. At the two ends of the grid an open square with a bar marks the mean and standard deviation over 200 replicate draws: 0.365 and 0.003 at 0.02, 0.365 and 0.006 at 0.40.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[275]/Pg 110850 0 R>>
endobj
